"The system implements an AI-enhanced educational 
assistant that combines deterministic learning 
analytics with extensible natural language 
processing. The current implementation uses 
rule-based educational reasoning, while the 
architecture is designed to support future 
integration with large language models through 
API-based services."


If a panel member asks:

"Why is this AI?"

You can confidently answer:

"A.L.E.C. is a rule-based intelligence system/AI. It analyzes structured student performance data,
applies predefined educational decision rules,
identifies learning patterns, evaluates 
student risk, and generates personalized 
recommendations and learning insights. Unlike
generative AI, every recommendation is 
explainable and traceable to measurable 
student performance."   

